Z||000000||Dan86gt3.8||03-23-2000||12:53 AM||||Yes this summer when I re-=paint I was looking to get some new side windows cause mine are cracked and have glazed over and you can't barely see through them,  they are also cracked where they are attached to the car, and have also had overspray on them from previous paint jobs.  Needless to say I need/want some new ones, and the fiero heaven ones sound good because they are not lexan, and some in clear or somked.  I also heaqrd the stoc ones are very expensive if you can find them, and you have to be ultra carefull when you put them on as to not breal them.  I talked to a guy intown and he said he cracked one putting it on and three days later a crack showed up on the new one on the other side.  Ohh by the way he paid a good like 250 a piece or something ridicoulous like that a piece from a dealer that still had some in stock. Does anyone have experience with theese gt side windows?  if you could give me some info on how hard they are to put on and where to get them and if the fiero heaven ones are as good as they claim.  thanks  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ||||reg||1
